---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
import '../styles/home.css';
import Spark from '../components/Spark.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Arka Pradana — Make attention mean something.">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <picture class="hero-picture">
      <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/media/arka-portrait.webp" />
      <img src="/media/arka-portrait.webp" srcset="/media/arka-portrait-960.webp 960w, /media/arka-portrait.webp 1536w" sizes="100vw" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Arka Pradana, a fictional marketing strategist, in an editorial studio portrait" fetchpriority="high" />
    </picture>
    <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-intro"><span class="availability-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>Independent mind.<br />Brand & growth strategist.</p></div>
    <h1 id="hero-title"><span>Make</span> <span>attention</span> <span class="hero-last">mean something.</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-person"><span class="hero-person-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>Arka Pradana<br /><span>Based in Jakarta. Thinking beyond borders.</span></p></div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><p>I connect what brands stand for<br />with what people care about.</p><a href="#work" class="hero-scroll"><span>Explore my world</span><span class="round-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6" /></svg></span></a><span class="hero-year">Portfolio / 2026</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-section" aria-labelledby="intro-title"><div class="intro-label"><span class="small-star" aria-hidden="true"><Spark /></span><p>A curious mind.<br />A considered approach.</p></div><div><h2 id="intro-title">Some see a brand.<br />I see its <span>next move.</span></h2><p class="intro-description">The best marketing doesn’t start with a channel. It starts with a question. I turn audience insight into a clear direction, then build campaigns that give people a reason to care.</p><a href="#approach" class="text-link">See how I think <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>

  <section id="work" class="work-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="work-heading"><div><p class="section-note">A few things I’ve thought through</p><h2 id="work-title">Selected<br />moves<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2></div><p>Different brands. Different challenges.<br />One belief: make every move matter.<br /><span>Three fictional strategy explorations.</span></p></div>
    <div class="work-grid">{projects.map((project, index) => <article class:list={['work-item', { 'work-featured': index === 0 }]}>
      <a class="work-card" href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}>
        <img src={project.image} srcset={`${project.image.replace('.webp','-640.webp')} 640w, ${project.image.replace('.webp','-960.webp')} 960w, ${project.image} 1536w`} sizes={index === 0 ? '(max-width: 767px) 90vw, 92vw' : '(max-width: 767px) 90vw, 45vw'} width="1536" height="1024" alt={`${project.brand} — ${project.description}`} loading="lazy" />
        <div class="work-card-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="campaign-brand">{project.brand}</span><div class="work-card-title"><h3>{project.title}</h3><span class="round-arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" /></svg></span></div>
      </a><div class="work-caption"><span>{project.category}</span><span>{project.year} / Concept project</span></div>
    </article>)}</div>
  </section>

  <section id="approach" class="approach-section" data-motion-scene data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="approach-heading"><p>Behind the thinking</p><h2 id="approach-title">A good campaign<br />starts before<br />the first click.</h2><p>No shortcuts to relevance.<br />Here’s the journey from a question<br />to a campaign with a point of view.</p></div>
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="scene-top"><span>From insight to launch</span><span>Aeru / After Hours</span><div class="scene-progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
      <div class="story-stages">
        <article class="story-stage insight-stage" data-stage-panel="0"><div class="stage-copy"><p class="stage-name"><span>01</span> Insight</p><h3>Find the<br />human truth.</h3><p>Look past the product specs. What does a better ride home really mean to someone?</p></div><div class="insight-art"><div class="brief-sheet"><span class="sheet-label">Aeru / Audience hypothesis</span><p>“What if the ride home<br />was the best part<br />of your day?”</p><div class="sheet-foot"><span>Not just a commute.<br />A little time of your own.</span><span class="sheet-star" aria-hidden="true"><Spark /></span></div></div><span class="paper-tag">Start with a better question.</span></div></article>
        <article class="story-stage idea-stage" data-stage-panel="1"><div class="stage-copy"><p class="stage-name"><span>02</span> Idea</p><h3>Give it<br />a direction.</h3><p>Turn that tension into a single-minded message. A thought that can travel across every touchpoint.</p></div><div class="idea-art"><span>Aeru / The campaign idea</span><p>Own<br />the ride<br />home.</p><span class="idea-stamp" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></article>
        <article class="story-stage launch-stage" data-stage-panel="2"><div class="stage-copy"><p class="stage-name"><span>03</span> Launch</p><h3>Make the<br />idea move.</h3><p>One clear idea. A connected campaign system. From the first impression to the next action.</p><a href="/work/after-hours/" class="text-link">Explore the strategy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="launch-art"><img src="/media/projects/after-hours-960.webp" width="960" height="640" alt="Fictional Aeru electric bicycle campaign key visual" loading="lazy" /><span class="launch-brand">aeru</span><p>Own the<br />ride home.</p><span class="launch-caption">After Hours / A fictional launch campaign</span></div></article>
      </div>
      <p class="scene-disclaimer">Illustrative strategy for a fictional brand. Audience insights are hypotheses, not field research.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="about-image-wrap"><img src="/media/arka-portrait-960.webp" width="960" height="640" alt="Portrait of Arka, the fictional strategist behind this concept portfolio" loading="lazy" /><span class="portrait-tag">Arka Pradana<br /><span>Always asking why.</span></span><span class="about-star" aria-hidden="true"><Spark /></span></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="section-note">A little about me</p><h2 id="about-title">Strategy is<br />a people thing.</h2><p>I’m Arka, a brand & growth strategist based in Jakarta. I’m drawn to the space where business ambition meets human behaviour. The interesting part? Finding the connection.</p><p>I work across positioning, campaign strategy, and acquisition journeys. A curious mind, a clear point of view, and a soft spot for the question nobody’s asked yet.</p><div class="experience"><div><span>2024–Now</span><p>Independent strategist<small>Brand, campaigns & growth</small></p></div><div><span>2022–2023</span><p>Brand strategist<small>Positioning & audience research</small></p></div><div><span>2020–2021</span><p>Marketing researcher<small>Frame Selatan / Fictional studio</small></p></div></div><p class="about-fiction">A fictional career, created to showcase a real website experience. <a href="/about-this-demo/">Meet the concept.</a></p></div></section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="contact-top"><p>A new perspective<br />can change everything.</p><span aria-hidden="true"><Spark /></span><p>Have a possibility<br />in mind?</p></div><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s plan<br />your next move.</h2><div class="contact-bottom"><button class="contact-button" data-open-brief>Create a project brief <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" /></svg></button><p>This is a concept portfolio.<br />Create a brief to keep on your device. Nothing is sent.</p></div><noscript><p class="no-js-note">The brief builder uses JavaScript. You can still explore every case study and read <a href="/about-this-demo/">about the concept</a>.</p></noscript></section>

  <dialog id="brief-dialog" class="brief-dialog" aria-labelledby="brief-title"><div class="brief-dialog-top"><span class="brief-logo">arka<span><Spark /></span></span><button data-close-brief aria-label="Close project brief">×</button></div><h2 id="brief-title">What’s your<br />next move?</h2><p>A starting point for a better conversation. This creates a text file on your device; no message is sent.</p><form><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="What should we call you?" /></label><label>Project type<select name="type"><option>Brand website</option><option>Personal portfolio</option><option>Campaign landing page</option><option>Something else</option></select></label></div><label>What would you like to achieve?<textarea name="goal" required maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="Tell us about the idea, the audience, and what success looks like."></textarea></label><label>Ideal timeline<select name="timeline"><option>Just exploring</option><option>Within 1 month</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>Flexible</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="download-brief">Download my brief <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></dialog>
  <script>import '../scripts/hero-motion';</script>
</BaseLayout>
